{
  "slug": "datadog",
  "name": "Datadog",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Use Datadog directly in Claude Code through a preconfigured Datadog MCP server. Query logs, metrics, traces, dashboards, and more through natural conversation. This plugin is in preview.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `datadog-app` (Use ONLY when the user explicitly asks to create, scaffold, or initialize a new Datadog App project —…), `ddconfig` (Configures or troubleshoots the plugin's Datadog MCP server), `ddsetup` (First-time initialization of the plugin's Datadog MCP server), `ddtoolsets` (Manages toolsets for the plugin's Datadog MCP server), `ddviz` (Enables, disables, or reports the status of the Datadog visualization panel (ddviz))\n- **Hooks** (2): `PostToolUse`, `SessionEnd`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install datadog@claude-plugins-official` from `datadog-labs/claude-code-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "hook": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
